id: SAVE19-3
package: fandhe-workshop-contract
test: history_load_order_contract
target: crates/contract/src/load_reason.rs
find:             LoadReason::OtherPack => HistoryLoadStage::Type,
replace:             LoadReason::OtherPack => HistoryLoadStage::Replay,
expect-fail: stage_is_non_decreasing_along_order
note: other_pack を適用し直しの段にして、段の単調性を崩す（次の bad_version より後ろの段になる）
